      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Zero hours after a shift"
      ],
      "text": "PeopleFlow calculates closed intervals every five minutes. An open session may show zero worked hours until clock-out closes the interval. Check the timeline rather than repeatedly pressing Clock out. A 09:00-17:30 interval with a 30-minute unpaid break should total 8.00 hours. Calculation uses UTC elapsed time, which can differ from local label subtraction during daylight-saving changes.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 6,
        "line": 8,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": null,
      "ordered": null,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "Diagnostic sequence",
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 8,
        "line": 9,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "1.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "Check the workplace timezone and both dates for overnight shifts.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 9,
        "line": 10,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "2.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "Confirm that clock-in, any break events, and clock-out appear in sequence.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 10,
        "line": 11,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "3.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "Wait one complete five-minute calculation cycle after the latest accepted event.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 11,
        "line": 12,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "4.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "Refresh once and inspect the calculation status.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": null,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": 0,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 12,
        "line": 13,
        "page": null,
        "part": null
      },
      "marker": "5.",
      "ordered": true,
      "rows": null,
      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Diagnostic sequence"
      ],
      "text": "If a closed valid interval remains zero, report its record reference and status to support.",
      "type": "list_item"
    },
    {
