      "section_path": [
        "Attendance Troubleshooting",
        "Missing and duplicate events"
      ],
      "text": "CLOCK-409 indicates an open session already exists or an already closed interval received another clock-out. Inspect the saved timeline before retrying; a duplicate rejection does not imply the original event was lost. CLOCK-422 indicates invalid ordering. PeopleFlow never invents a missing clock-out from the published shift end. Use Attendance Correction Guide v2 to request the missing event with an accurate reason and a complete proposed timeline.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
        "bbox": null,
        "element": 15,
        "line": 18,
